text:
i can't fucking stand cutting. it's 1:22. i can't sleep because of the heat. i'm starving. there's so much good food downstairs that i can't touch because it will fuck up both todays suffering through the same old poultry and broccoli and my mental discipline. i'm not even halfway done. i've got weeks and weeks to go of this shit. will it even be worth it once i finish and end up, even when clean bulking, adding on 50lbs of fat in the space of 2 days?

&amp;#x200b;

i know this is what makes having a good physique impressive, but i fucking love food. i hate having to lie here hungry. i hate busting my ass off in the gym, knowing the workout is 'wasted' because i won't make gains in my deficit. i hate cutting. the end.
